'''Grimmen Lake''' is a lake located directly east of the [[Plump Pumpkin]] in [[Northwind]] that is crawling with bloodthirsty [[murloc]]s. Adventurers hunting murlocs in the lake should make sure to keep an eye open for the [[Grimmen Thresher]] that can be occasionally sighted patrolling the deeps.

